<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#14181F">
<title><%= title %></title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow+Condensed:wght@600;700;800&family=Hanken+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/login.css">
</head>
<body>
<div class="lg">
  <section class="lg-hero">
    <div class="lg-brand">
      <div class="lg-logo">
        <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#14181F" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 11h16a8 8 0 0 1-16 0z"></path><path d="M9 7c0-1.5 1-1.5 1-3M14 7c0-1.5 1-1.5 1-3"></path></svg>
      </div>
      <p>Nalla Malla Reddy Engineering College</p>
    </div>
    <div class="lg-copy">
      <h1 class="lg-h1">Order ahead.<br>Pick up hot.</h1>
      <p class="lg-lead">Choose your food between classes, pay by UPI or at the counter, and collect it with a pickup token. No queue.</p>
      <ul class="lg-list">
        <li><span class="lg-tick"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#14181F" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7.5"></path></svg></span>Live menu with availability and prep times</li>
        <li><span class="lg-tick"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#14181F" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7.5"></path></svg></span>Track every order from placed to ready</li>
        <li><span class="lg-tick"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#14181F" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m5 12.5 4.5 4.5L19 7.5"></path></svg></span>Separate console for canteen staff</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="lg-plates" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="plate"><i style="background: #F3D9A4"></i></div>
      <div class="plate"><i style="background: #CFE3C6"></i></div>
    </div>
    <p class="lg-note">Students sign in with a roll number or college email. Staff accounts are made by the canteen office.</p>
  </section>

  <main class="lg-main">
    <!-- login.js draws the sign-in / register card inside this box -->
    <div id="card" class="lg-card"></div>
  </main>
</div>
<script src="/js/login.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
